.TH SSH-PWD "1" "March 2024" "SSH-TOOLS" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
ssh-pwd
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
ssh\-pwd [PATH]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
quickly echo path to use for scp, rsync
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.TP
\fI\,/etc/ssh\-tools/ssh\-pwd/targets\/\fP
.TP
\fI~/.config/ssh\-tools/ssh\-pwd/targets\fP
.P
Just pust some IPs, FQDNs in there
.br
and they will be shown in the output as well
